\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Training dynamics and efficiency analysis. (a)~mAP progression during 72-epoch training. FreqSpatial converges faster and surpasses the final Baseline (46.73\%) by epoch~50; dotted horizontal lines mark final mAP of each model. (b)~Accuracy-speed trade-off on an RTX~3090. FreqSpatial achieves higher mAP (48.18\%) at 38.5~FPS, remaining well above the real-time threshold.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
